The login field macros derive from Keycloak 26.8.1, with password visibility
controls removed and the remaining upstream field behavior retained. The shared
login template derives from the same release and adds an advance access-policy
notice before forms and uniform login-error presentation. Credential-field errors
are presented in that shared alert. Upstream protocol and form actions are retained.
